<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-129-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.503585" lon="-121.08616"><name>SC26-129-C</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 53/100; not catch probability. Center 153 ft; nearby 150–184 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 586 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-104</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.505554891128604" lon="-121.08815248495436"/><trkpt lat="35.50537815198984" lon="-121.08837717362469"/><trkpt lat="35.505017685809406" lon="-121.08838571881508"/><trkpt lat="35.50473860080747" lon="-121.08784109316777"/><trkpt lat="35.504199648876785" lon="-121.08796412031869"/><trkpt lat="35.5041060377754" lon="-121.08774584499194"/><trkpt lat="35.5038356881849" lon="-121.08775225571416"/><trkpt lat="35.50383219325461" lon="-121.08753184448277"/><trkpt lat="35.50356009608694" lon="-121.08742805062485"/><trkpt lat="35.50355485268731" lon="-121.08709743498407"/><trkpt lat="35.50382520218692" lon="-121.08709102213378"/><trkpt lat="35.50381995782995" lon="-121.08676040547171"/><trkpt lat="35.503189142431786" lon="-121.08677537123849"/><trkpt lat="35.50308503693258" lon="-121.08589587302242"/><trkpt lat="35.5026344546855" lon="-121.0859065674422"/><trkpt lat="35.50253559200615" lon="-121.08535768770462"/><trkpt lat="35.50190652639687" lon="-121.08548286656958"/><trk